Georgios Kontaxis <kontaxis@github>
    Original author (2015). Designed and wrote the core TLS SNI and HTTP
    Host header extraction engine, the pcap integration, and the dual
    Ethernet/raw-IP binary architecture.

Alvaro Reguly <alvarow@github>
    Extended the codebase (2026): IPv6 support with extension header
    walking, PCRE2 migration, JSON and timestamped output modes, -c/-q/-t
    flags, Host header port stripping, pcap_datalink validation, assert
    replacement with proper bounds checks, signal handling cleanup,
    refactored global state into packet_ctx, HTTP method coverage
    (HTTP/1.0, PATCH, WebDAV), man page, install target, systemd/rc.d/
    logrotate service files, pfSense deployment documentation.
